+Success is `{"ok": True, "action": <verb>}` (topic creation also returns
+`thread_id`). `ensure_private_topic` is Telegram-only and idempotently reuses
+an existing configured title; the Telegram adapter remains responsible for
+topic creation and persistent `dm_topics` metadata. Failures are
 `{"ok": False, "error": <code>, "detail": <str>}` with stable error codes:
 `capability_not_granted`, `invalid_argument`, `gateway_unavailable`,
